<title>ISRAEL: Tel Aviv exchange to adopt Reuters symbols.</title>
<headline>Tel Aviv exchange to adopt Reuters symbols.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tel Aviv Stock Exchange said on Thursday it would use Reuters symbols for shares and convertibles traded in Tel Aviv to facilitate international investors' involvement in the Israeli market.</p>
<p>The exchange disseminates its trading data around the world through Reuters and through its Internet website.</p>
<p>The newly adopted symbols are known as RICs (Reuters Instrument Codes).</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
